{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_231_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，齊國夏、衞石曼姑帥師圍戚。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"此衞事也，其先國夏何也？子不圍父也。不繫戚於衞者，子不有父也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，甲午，地震。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"三、五月，辛卯，桓宮、僖宮災。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"言及，則祖有尊卑，由我言之，則一也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"四、季孫斯、叔孫州仇帥師城啟陽。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"五、宋樂髠帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月，丙子，季孫斯卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"七、蔡人放其大夫公孫獵於吳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，癸卯，秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_231_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_231","textTraditional":"九、叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌帥師圍邾。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}